    "text": "IT is hereby notified under Regulation 30 of the Wages Boards Regulations Published in Gazette No. 14961 dated 04.06.1971that the Hon. Minister of labour Trade Union Relations and Sabaragamuwa Development that has been pleased to appoint thefollowing persons to be members of the Wages Board for the Cocoa, Cardamom and Pepper Growing and ManufacturingTrade, by virtue of the powers vested in the Hon. Minister of Labour under Section 09 of the Wages Boards Ordinance(Chapter 136) No. 27 of 1941, for a period of three years commencing on 01st August 2017.",
